  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar ITI CAT 2025 Offline Mop-Up Counselling</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2025-09-08T17:01:04+05:30\">September 8, 2025</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">5:01 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\">Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</a>, </strong>The official website has been <strong>released</strong> <strong>2nd Round Allotment Result</strong> \u00a0for the <strong>admission</strong> to the <strong>I.T.I.C.A.T</strong> 2025. The exam was conducted in <strong>15 June 2025.</strong> The <strong>BCECEB</strong> application form will started on <strong>6th March 2025</strong>, and candidates can fill out the form until<strong> 24th May 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>Seat Matrix</strong>\u00a0using their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"302\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            background-color: #25D366;\n        }\n        .whatsapp:hover {\n            background-color: #1EBE57;\n        }\n        .telegram {\n            background-color: #0088cc;\n        }\n        .telegram:hover {\n            background-color: #0078b8;\n        }\n        .icon {\n            margin-right: 8px;\n        }\n    </style></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a class=\"apply-button\" href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n</div>\n<style>\n        /* Button Style */\n        .apply-button {\n            text-align:center;\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 15px 30px;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: red;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-align: center;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n        }\n\n    \n    </style>\n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> Telegram </a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">Bihar ITI CAT Offline Mop-Up Counselling 2025</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">Bihar ITI-CAT Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bihar-iti-cat-2025-offline-mop-up-counselling-date-extended/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <b>06 March 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<b> 24 May 2025 (Extended)</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date Online Payment :\u00a0<b>25 May 2025</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Correction Date : <strong>26-27 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 15 June 2025</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Available :\u00a0<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>07 June 2025</b></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared Date :<b> 02 July 2025</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General, EWS, OBC : <b><strong>\u20b9\u00a0</strong>750/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC, ST : <b><strong>\u20b9 </strong></b><strong>100/-\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">PH : <b><strong>\u20b9 </strong></b><strong>430/-\u00a0</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;