: 14pt;\">14 August 2025</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Downloading of Allotment Order (2nd Round)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">14 August \u2013 19 August 2025</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Documents Verification &amp; Admission (2nd Round)</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">17 August \u2013 19 August 2025</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Willingness for MOP-UP Counselling</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">To be announced</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Publication of MOP-UP Counselling Programme</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">To be announced</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Start of Offline MOP-UP Counselling</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">To be announced</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/mpesb-group-4-various-post-recruitment-2025/\">MPESB Group 4 Various Post Online Form 2025</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; Download Bihar ITI CAT 2025 2nd Round Allotment Result\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"107\" data-start=\"76\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1. Visit Official Website</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"184\" data-start=\"108\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors dur