DV_ITICAT25_01.pdf\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Official Website</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><a href=\"http://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Click Here</strong></span></a></h5>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Important Question\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> When will the online application for<strong> Bihar ITI-CAT\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong> start?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The online application for this exam Has Started On <strong>06 March 2025.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the last date for <strong>Bihar ITI-CAT</strong><strong>\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The last date (<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Extended)</strong></span> to apply online for this exam is <strong>24 May 2025.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the age limit for <strong>Bihar ITI-CAT</strong><strong>\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The age limit for candidates applying for this exam is as per the <strong>Bihar ITI-CAT</strong>\u00a0rules. For detailed age-related information, refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <strong>Bihar ITI-CAT</strong><strong>\u00a0Online Form 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Must have completed their 10+2 (Intermediate) or High School level exam, with English and Hindi as compulsory subjects.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For More Details Read Notification</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of <strong>BCECEB?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of <strong>BCECEB </strong>is <strong>http://bceceboard.bihar.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Bihar ITI CAT 2025 2nd Round Allotment Result\" class=\"size-large wp-image-22990 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bihar-ITI-1st-Seat-Allotment-2025-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bihar-ITI-1st-Seat-Allotment-2025-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bihar-ITI-1st-Seat-Allotment-2025-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bihar-ITI-1st-Seat-Allotment-2025-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bihar-ITI-1st-Seat-Allotment-2025.jpg 1200w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-t